# Local generated project analysis
/Docs/AI/UnityProjectContext.md

# Local Unity host project used to develop this package
/Assets/
/ProjectSettings/
/Packages/

# The external Agent Bridge is a checked-in .NET project. The trailing `~`
# keeps Unity Package Manager from importing the bridge as Editor content.
!/Bridge~/*.csproj
/Bridge~/bin/
/Bridge~/obj/
